<title>SOUTH KOREA: Bank of Korea says to supply 1.4 trln won to banks.</title>
<headline>Bank of Korea says to supply 1.4 trln won to banks.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central Bank of Korea said on Friday it has decided to supply 1.4 trillion won to commercial banks through three-day repurchase agreements to relieve severe shortages in market liquidity.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have decided to supply 1.4 trillion won to the banking system as it appeared too short to meet reserve requirement obligations,&quot; said an official at the Bank of Korea.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
